Brentano Math & Science Academy is a high-performing neighborhood school where students love learning and where teachers love teaching. We emphasize inquiry, project-based learning, and a commitment to the whole child.  

The Brentano approach includes daily arts classes and daily PE for all students, as well as after-school sports, gardening, drama, dance, visual arts, and more. Come visit!

